Add a "Disable for CLI commands" setting to the late runtime processor.

Based on purge MR !46 (https://www.drupal.org/project/purge/issues/3462078,
commit 14c09e0ec4f1f46df0f19876ad6b3e8c93921e00), rebased onto purge 8.x-3.8
where plugin annotations became PHP attributes.

